      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/101700401/1017004010190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そりゃ、ワンマンライブが迫ってるからな\r\nやることいっぱいだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あさひも、スケジュールいっぱいだろう？\r\n疲れを溜め込まないように……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017004010200,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "大丈夫っすよ！",
    "charAnim1": "surp3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700401/1017004010200"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017004010210,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "いっぱい歌って踊れて、\r\nステージ楽しみっす！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700401/1017004010210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、頼もしいな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、ワンマンはあさひにとっても初めてのことだし\r\n気を付け──",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017004010220,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "あっ、新しいこと……\r\n『ワンマンライブ』じゃだめっすかね",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700401/1017004010220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まぁ、初っていうことではそうだけど\r\n今回聞かれているのはそういうのじゃなくて……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──そうだ、あさひ\r\nどうせなら、作っちゃえばいいんじゃないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "se": "0220"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "アンケートに書けるような、\r\n何か『新しいこと』を始めてしまうんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017004010230,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700401/1017004010230"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017004010240,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "いっすけど",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700401/1017004010240"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017004010250,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "それで、何するっすか？",
    "charAnim1": "surp3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700401/1017004010250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？　それはまだ考えてないんだけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017004010260,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "えー",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700401/1017004010260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、いやすまん\r\n俺も思いつきで言ったからさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだなぁ、たとえば誰かに\r\nやってみたらって勧められたことはないか？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017004010270,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "……あー、この前、トレーナーさんに\r\n走り込みを増やしてほしいって言われたっす",
    "charAnim1": "think1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700401/1017004010270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いいじゃないか\r\nやってみたらどうだ？",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017004010280,
